---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Pressleaf Support" description="In Safari, open Share and choose Pressleaf. Open Pressleaf to finish processing a queued link. You can also paste a web address into Pressleaf, or drag a link into the app window on Mac." lang="en">
  <article>
    <nav aria-label="Language">
      <a href="/pressleaf/support/" hreflang="en" lang="en" aria-current="page">English</a>
      <a href="/pressleaf/support/ko/" hreflang="ko" lang="ko">한국어</a>
    </nav>

    <h1>Pressleaf Support</h1>
    <section>
      <h2>Save a link</h2>
      <p>In Safari, open Share and choose Pressleaf. Open Pressleaf to finish processing a queued link. You can also paste a web address into Pressleaf, or drag a link into the app window on Mac.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Enable Pressleaf in Share</h2>
      <p>On iPhone, scroll the app row in the share sheet to More and enable Pressleaf. On Mac, open the Share menu, choose Edit Extensions and enable Pressleaf.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Import a reading list</h2>
      <p>Use the file import option and select an Instapaper CSV, a Pocket HTML export, or an Omnivore ZIP or metadata JSON export. Review the detected links and confirm to queue them.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>When a page fails</h2>
      <p>Open the original in your browser to check whether it still loads, then retry in Pressleaf. If Pressleaf reports a missing page, choose Find in Wayback Machine when offered. If a copy is available, choose whether to import it. Some sites restrict access or cannot be converted.</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:oozoofrog@oozoofrog.dev">oozoofrog@oozoofrog.dev</a></p>
    </section>
    <footer><a href="/pressleaf/privacy/">Pressleaf Privacy Policy</a></footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article { max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.65; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
  section, footer { margin-block: 1.5rem; }
</style>
